  note:{h:"Numbers, prices and 'per'",html:`<table><tr><th>Write</th><th>Say</th></tr><tr><td>€12.50</td><td>twelve euros fifty</td></tr><tr><td>£1,200 per month</td><td>one thousand two hundred pounds a month / per month</td></tr><tr><td>3–5 days</td><td>three to five days</td></tr><tr><td>-10%</td><td>a ten per cent discount</td></tr></table><div class="bz-box tip">If you don't know the answer, never guess. <b>“Let me check that and get back to you”</b> sounds more professional than a wrong answer.</div>`},
