  bank:{h:"Complete the reply to a customer",text:"Dear Mr Novak,\n\nThank you for your questions about the X200 scanner. Good news: {it's in stock}, and {delivery takes} two to three working days. The price is €340 {per unit}, and {we can offer a discount on} orders of ten or more. The scanner {comes with a two-year guarantee}, and {our support team is available 24/7}. You asked about installation in your office — {I'm afraid we don't offer that at the moment}, but our video guide makes it very easy.\n\nKind regards,\nLena Fischer",extra:["on stock","out of stock"]},
