   steps:[["Thank them","Thank you for your interest in …"],["Price","It costs … per … / We can offer a discount on …"],["Delivery","It's in stock. Delivery takes …"],["Guarantee and support","It comes with a … guarantee. Our support team …"],["Next step","Please let me know if you have any other questions."]],
   topics:["An office coffee machine","An online accounting app","Electric bikes for company staff","A cleaning service"],
