  note:{h:"Suggestion patterns: the verb form",html:`<table><tr><th>Phrase</th><th>+ form</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td>Why don't we</td><td>verb</td><td>Why don't we <b>call</b> them?</td></tr><tr><td>How about / What about</td><td>-ing</td><td>How about <b>calling</b> them?</td></tr><tr><td>We could / I suggest that we</td><td>verb</td><td>We could <b>call</b> them.</td></tr><tr><td>One option would be</td><td>to + verb</td><td>One option would be <b>to call</b> them.</td></tr></table><p class="no">✗ How about call them? ✗ I suggest to call them. ✗ Why we don't call them?</p>`},
