  bank:{h:"Complete the action points email",text:"Hi all,\n\nThanks for a useful meeting. We looked at {the pros and cons} of the two solutions and decided to {go with} the new courier. {If we} change now, {we'll} save around €1,200 a month. {The downside is that} we need to train the warehouse team.\n\nAction points:\n– Tomek {will take care of} the contract.\n– Kasia, {can you} train the team {by} 15 May?\n{The next step is to} test it with ten orders. {Let's meet again on} 20 May {to see how it's going}.\n\nBest,\nAnna",extra:["If we will","until"]},
